    "text": "By Justin Kraiza ,\n1 hours ago SAN ANTONIO - Authorities are asking for your help in locating a suspect involved in an aggravated robbery on the city's Northeast Side. On Sept. 26, a 61-year-old woman was approached by an unknown male suspect in the parking lot of an apartment complex at 8033 N. New Braunfels Ave. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
